==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* [[Lance]], [[Pryce]], and {{adv|Giovanni}} battle and defeat the [[Pokémon of myth]].
* Pryce was chosen by {{adv|Celebi}} to exit the [[Ilex Forest]] Shrine and participate in the battle.
* {{adv|Gold}} battles {{adv|Arceus}} alone.
* Gold's {{p|Togepi}} evolves into {{p|Togetic}}, and then into {{p|Togekiss}}.
* Togepi's [[Evolution]] calms Arceus's anger, because his [[friendship]] with Gold restores Arceus's faith in humans.
* [[Petrel]] had defeated Lance by disguising himself as {{adv|Yellow}}.
* [[Radio Director|Hiro]] reveals his plans on making [[Proteam Omega|an anime series]]. {{adv|Silver}} becomes interested in Proteam Omega.
* [[Cynthia]] meets [[Palmer]], and he reveals that a [[Reg|Regigigas]] is in his possession.
* {{adv|Black}}, {{adv|Bianca}}, and {{adv|Cheren}} start their journey.
* Black receives a {{p|Tepig}}, and names it [[Bo|Tep]].
* Cheren receives a {{TP|Cheren|Snivy}}.
* Bianca receives an {{TP|Bianca|Oshawott}}.
* Black wins his first Trainer battle.

