===Evolutions===
* Gold's {{p|Togepi}} "[[Togebo]]" evolves into {{p|Togetic}} in [[PS459]].
* Gold's {{p|Togetic}} "Togebo" evolves into {{p|Togekiss}} in [[PS459]].

==Trivia==
===Localization===
The [[VIZ Media]] release omits the first four chapters from the volume. These chapters were later included on {{PAV|42}}. Similar splits were done with {{PAV|14}} and {{PAV|15}}, where the final chapter of the {{MangaArc|Gold, Silver & Crystal}} was moved from the beginning of Volume 15 to the end of Volume 14, and later with {{PAV|22}} and {{PAV|23}}, where the first two chapters of the {{MangaArc|FireRed & LeafGreen}} were moved to Volume 23.

The first four chapters have also been omitted from the {{pmin|Germany|German}}, {{pmin|Brazil}}ian, and {{pmin|Latin America}}n releases by [[Panini Comics]], and later included on Volume 42 as well.

